  "field_definition": "perp_close: real 5m kline close from C312 (strictly positive, gap-free); log_return=log(c[t]/c[t-1]) (r[0]=0) derived from perp_close; abs_ret=|log_return|; funding_rate all-NaN control (USDT-M funding unreachable); sign=sign(log_return) (+1/-1/0, sign[0]=0). Runner builds DISTCOR (distance correlation, Szekely-Rizzo-Bakirov 2007) scalars over fixed intrinsic window W=128: for two causal series X,Y, a_ij=|X_i-X_j|, b_ij=|Y_i-Y_j| double-centered A_ij=a_ij-\u0101_i.-\u0101_.j+\u0101_.., B_ij likewise; dCov2=mean(A*B), dVar2_X=mean(A*A), dVar2_Y=mean(B*B); dCor=sqrt(dCov2/sqrt(dVar2_X*dVar2_Y)) in [0,1], =0 iff X independent Y (captures ALL dependence, linear+nonlinear). Concepts: dcor_serial=mean over k in {1,2,4} dCor(r[t-k],r[t]); dcor_volserial=mean over k dCor(|r[t-k]|,|r[t]|); dcor_market=dCor(r_i[t],mean_i r_i[t]); dcor_signmag=dCor(sign(r[t]),|r[t]|). NaN if t<W or any NaN/non-finite in the trailing window or degenerate window (zero variance) or not finite. Seasonal deviation of each DISTCOR scalar at the same (weekday,tod) bucket from history strictly before bar t (causal shift(1)), NaN-aware min_periods=3.",
